LOOP

COMMENT
Date: 2026-09-23
Title: Test FM with DDS4 with DIGITAL channel 3 as trigger
Notes:
- EOM freq has code 48
- EOM amp has code 49
- ramp frequency from 10002 MHz to 10004 MHz in 40 ms

To setup SA Rigol:
- Span -> Full Span
- Press peak
- Freq -> CF peak
- Span -> Zero Span
- Sweep/Trig -> Time: 40 ms
ENDCOMMENT

INIT
Trigger EOM = Off                                                      (3)
EOM Amp = [20]                                                         (49)
EOM Freq = 10002 kHz                                                 (48)
ENDINIT

INNER
+1s             Trigger = On                                                 (3)
+50us           RAMP EOM Freq TO 10004 kHz IN 40ms (200 STEPS)              (48)
+20.1ms         Trigger = Off                                                (3)
ENDINNER

ITERATIONS 10

ENDLOOP
